<PolicyLayout title="Accessibility" lede="How this site aims to be usable by everyone.">
  <p>This site aims to meet WCAG 2.2 AA where practical. It uses semantic headings and landmarks, a skip link, visible focus states, and works without JavaScript. Figures should have text alternatives and stated uncertainty. To report a barrier, use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
